      <div class="steps four"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You keep repeating a pattern and you are ready to see where it started.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Business owners</h3><p>Your company still runs on decisions and habits you set years ago.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Teams</h3><p>Old habits and old hurts keep the team working the way it always has.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">04</div><h3>Families</h3><p>Several histories under one roof. We make them visible so you can choose together.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: your first key tomorrow morning, a 30-minute conversation with Russ in your first week, then $99 a month. The first week is on us. <a href="/plans/">See all plans and pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

